[43.857438, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.832482ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.214496ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.447873ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.400524ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
[43.85834, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.292583ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ selection uses exact branch tags or stack IDs, not names or stack prefixes \u001b[90m(0.234392ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ deletion order handles shuffled graphs, shared dependencies and disconnected resources \u001b[90m(0.464922ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plans retain outside dependents as blockers without selecting them \u001b[90m(0.187394ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ dependency cycles fail planning rather than producing an unsafe partial order \u001b[90m(0.668842ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ empty and already-deleted branches have empty plans \u001b[90m(0.413446ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
